:: volcano [volcano mount-boom-boom]
<div class='flex-row flex items-center gap-lg'>
  <div class='explore-box'>
    <h3>EXPLORE</h3>
    <ul class='choices'>
      <li>[[You see some sparks coming from behind a rock.->'stray: bakewing']]</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <<map 'volcano'>><<east 'volcano'>><<west 'f5'>><</map>><<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition = 'volcano'>>
</div>

:: stray: bakewing [mount-boom-boom stray rare]
<img class='mergimal-image' src='images/mergimals/bakewing.png' />

You see a small, red Mergimal that is chewing on some branches.

Do Worksheet 84.1

<<nobr>>
    <<set $tamedPassage = 'tamed: bakewing'>>
    <<link 'Throw a mergiball!'>>
        <<if $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].backpack.mergiball < 1>>
            <<dialog>>
                <<include 'no mergiballs'>>
            <</dialog>>
        <<else>>
            <<dialog>>
                <<include 'tame attempt'>>
            <</dialog>>
        <</if>>
    <</link>>
<</nobr>>
[[They got away: continue exploring.->volcano]]

:: tamed: bakewing [mt-boom-boom tamed]
<<card 'bakewing'>>
This fiesty Mergimal eats trees whole to fuel the fire in their oven belly, which they use to make pizza. Yum!

<<link 'You tamed them.' 'volcano'>><<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].mergipedia.bakewing = 'tamed'>><<set $tamedPassage = ''>><</link>>